{%- comment -%}
  Renders a single floating gadget as an optimized inline SVG "transparent render".
  Dependency-free alternative to a GLB/Three.js stage: crisp at any size, zero
  network cost, and animated entirely with lightweight CSS 3D in base.css.

  Accepts:
  - kind: {string} phone | earbuds | charger | headphones | watch | keyboard | mouse | controller | speaker
  - uid: {string} unique prefix for gradient/pattern ids (required — avoids SVG id collisions)
  - with_mic: {boolean} adds a boom mic to the headphones (gaming headset)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign g = uid | default: 'dev'
-%}
{%- case kind -%}

{%- when 'phone' -%}
